1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:02,220
if your elevator has a button with your full

2
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:05,470
name on it do not press it

3
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:07,600
do not photograph it

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,690
and do not confirm that the spelling is correct

5
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:14,290
the button will usually appear below the ground floor

6
00:00:14,290 --> 00:00:16,720
there are seven rules

7
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:18,800
you will need the last one when the door

8
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:19,960
is open

9
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:21,231
rule one

10
00:00:21,231 --> 00:00:23,551
keep your hands away from the panel

11
00:00:23,551 --> 00:00:26,251
your name may already be illuminated

12
00:00:26,251 --> 00:00:28,211
this does not mean you pressed it

13
00:00:28,211 --> 00:00:29,861
look above the doors

14
00:00:29,861 --> 00:00:32,811
the display will say collection accepted

15
00:00:32,811 --> 00:00:34,711
do not press cancel

16
00:00:34,711 --> 00:00:36,641
there is no cancel button

17
00:00:36,641 --> 00:00:39,641
there is a button you have mistaken for one

18
00:00:39,641 --> 00:00:42,311
the small symbol beneath it is a person lying

19
00:00:42,311 --> 00:00:43,539
down

20
00:00:43,539 --> 00:00:44,699
rule two

21
00:00:44,699 --> 00:00:47,599
do not confirm your details

22
00:00:47,599 --> 00:00:50,099
the screen may ask whether you are the person

23
00:00:50,099 --> 00:00:51,839
listed do

24
00:00:51,839 --> 00:00:54,099
not select yes

25
00:00:54,099 --> 00:00:56,979
do not select no

26
00:00:56,979 --> 00:00:59,719
the question is not testing your identity

27
00:00:59,719 --> 00:01:03,089
it is checking whether the contents can respond

28
00:01:03,089 --> 00:01:05,279
the wait display will update

29
00:01:05,279 --> 00:01:07,119
do not remove your coat to see if it

30
00:01:07,119 --> 00:01:08,479
changes

31
00:01:08,479 --> 00:01:12,199
weight adjustments are processed as missing items

32
00:01:12,199 --> 00:01:16,189
the elevator will wait for them to be returned

33
00:01:16,189 --> 00:01:17,459
rule three

34
00:01:17,459 --> 00:01:18,759
face the doors

35
00:01:18,759 --> 00:01:20,289
not the mirror

36
00:01:20,289 --> 00:01:22,939
the mirror will show the back of your head

37
00:01:22,939 --> 00:01:25,468
this may take a moment to notice

38
00:01:25,468 --> 00:01:28,418
do not turn around to correct it

39
00:01:28,418 --> 00:01:30,868
a white rectangle may appear on the shoulder of

40
00:01:30,868 --> 00:01:32,458
your reflection

41
00:01:32,458 --> 00:01:34,728
the words will be backward

42
00:01:34,728 --> 00:01:37,148
you do not need to read them

43
00:01:37,148 --> 00:01:39,658
if you can make out this side up

44
00:01:39,658 --> 00:01:41,628
remain standing

45
00:01:41,628 --> 00:01:44,788
if the label changes to handle with care keep

46
00:01:44,788 --> 00:01:47,151
your arms close to your body

47
00:01:47,151 --> 00:01:49,631
someone has noticed you moving

48
00:01:49,631 --> 00:01:51,111
rule four

49
00:01:51,111 --> 00:01:53,651
do not ask which floor you are on

50
00:01:53,651 --> 00:01:56,241
the elevator may travel longer than the height of

51
00:01:56,241 --> 00:01:58,261
your building permits

52
00:01:58,261 --> 00:02:00,371
you may feel it turn a corner

53
00:02:00,371 --> 00:02:02,001
hold the rail

54
00:02:02,001 --> 00:02:04,431
do not ask about the corner

55
00:02:04,431 --> 00:02:07,751
the floor display will stop showing numbers

56
00:02:07,751 --> 00:02:09,909
it will show surnames

57
00:02:09,909 --> 00:02:11,699
some will be familiar

58
00:02:11,699 --> 00:02:14,449
do not say that you know those people

59
00:02:14,449 --> 00:02:17,859
that information would be useful to the route planner

60
00:02:17,859 --> 00:02:19,049
rule five

61
00:02:19,049 --> 00:02:21,509
do not help with the trolley

62
00:02:21,509 --> 00:02:24,079
at the next opening a person in a uniform

63
00:02:24,079 --> 00:02:26,919
may push an empty trolley inside

64
00:02:26,919 --> 00:02:28,649
they will hold the door

65
00:02:28,649 --> 00:02:29,749
they may say

66
00:02:29,749 --> 00:02:31,890
just enough room for one

67
00:02:31,890 --> 00:02:33,680
stay beside the panel

68
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:36,670
do not step onto the trolley

69
00:02:36,670 --> 00:02:38,540
do not lean on it

70
00:02:38,540 --> 00:02:40,750
if they ask you to hold the clipboard

71
00:02:40,750 --> 00:02:43,390
keep your hands at your sides

72
00:02:43,390 --> 00:02:47,690
you will notice the first signature is already yours

73
00:02:47,690 --> 00:02:51,020
we have received several complaints about it

74
00:02:51,020 --> 00:02:52,320
all were marked

75
00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:53,680
delivered

76
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:56,270
rule six do not leave

77
00:02:56,270 --> 00:02:57,490
when you hear

78
00:02:57,490 --> 00:02:58,850
arrived

79
00:02:58,850 --> 00:03:02,650
the doors may open onto a corridor you recognize

80
00:03:02,650 --> 00:03:04,710
your door mat will be there

81
00:03:04,710 --> 00:03:07,190
someone will be waiting at your door

82
00:03:07,190 --> 00:03:09,260
they will be holding a pen

83
00:03:09,260 --> 00:03:11,170
do not greet them

84
00:03:11,170 --> 00:03:14,010
do not tell them they have the wrong apartment

85
00:03:14,010 --> 00:03:16,464
look at the number beside the door

86
00:03:16,464 --> 00:03:18,184
it will be your name

87
00:03:18,184 --> 00:03:20,794
the person will look past your face toward the

88
00:03:20,794 --> 00:03:22,724
label on your shoulder

89
00:03:22,724 --> 00:03:25,704
they have been sent to photograph

90
00:03:25,704 --> 00:03:27,944
you were not smiling in it

91
00:03:27,944 --> 00:03:29,364
rule seven

92
00:03:29,364 --> 00:03:31,464
say wrong address

93
00:03:31,464 --> 00:03:33,494
only those two words

94
00:03:33,494 --> 00:03:35,334
do not explain

95
00:03:35,334 --> 00:03:37,425
do not apologize

96
00:03:37,425 --> 00:03:40,525
do not provide the correct address

97
00:03:40,525 --> 00:03:43,875
the person with a pen will check the clipboard

98
00:03:43,875 --> 00:03:46,265
the elevator will remain open

99
00:03:46,265 --> 00:03:47,345
wait

100
00:03:47,345 --> 00:03:50,885
if they ask whether you are sure say nothing

101
00:03:50,885 --> 00:03:52,585
if they ask who ordered you

102
00:03:52,585 --> 00:03:53,875
say nothing

103
00:03:53,875 --> 00:03:57,829
they will eventually draw a line through your name

104
00:03:57,829 --> 00:04:00,759
only then may you press the ground floor

105
00:04:00,759 --> 00:04:03,039
the numbers will have returned

106
00:04:03,039 --> 00:04:06,419
leave the building by the nearest ordinary door

107
00:04:06,419 --> 00:04:08,089
before going home

108
00:04:08,089 --> 00:04:10,029
check the back of your coat

109
00:04:10,029 --> 00:04:13,009
remove the white label without reading the address

110
00:04:13,009 --> 00:04:14,369
fold it inward

111
00:04:14,369 --> 00:04:17,519
place it beneath something too heavy for one person

112
00:04:17,519 --> 00:04:18,863
to lift

113
00:04:18,863 --> 00:04:23,103
the office of household continuity has confirmed your return

114
00:04:23,103 --> 00:04:26,443
you may use the stairs until further notice

115
00:04:26,443 --> 00:04:28,323
if someone knocks tonight

116
00:04:28,323 --> 00:04:30,623
allow them to finish speaking

117
00:04:30,623 --> 00:04:34,043
they will say a delivery was attempted

118
00:04:34,043 --> 00:04:37,043
they will ask when you will be available

119
00:04:37,043 --> 00:04:38,648
do not give them a time

